{"ID":"20240118145004-ukdj1g5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145004-ukdj1g5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145004-ukdj1g5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145004-11h86yz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164027-wlxdpoq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122164027-wlxdpoq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:56,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:56\u0026#125;","title":"356水斳（芹菜）357彼子","type":"doc","updated":"20240204154342"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145004-11h86yz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145004-11h86yz","updated":"20240122163955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"水斳"}]},{"ID":"20240122163950-74srysh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163950-74srysh","updated":"20240122163959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名水英。味甘，平，无毒。治女子赤沃，止血，养精，保血脉，益气，令人肥健，嗜食。生南海，池泽。又名芹菜。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164001-1nxuova","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164001-1nxuova"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164004-ldscj0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164004-ldscj0s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘性平，有特殊的香味。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164005-j5z9pps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164005-j5z9pps"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】解热止血，健胃药，治女子血崩赤带，小儿暴热，大人酒后热。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164006-8t7wim5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164006-8t7wim5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】主女子赤沃，止血养精，保血脉，益气，令人肥健，嗜食。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164008-5etbep8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164008-5etbep8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】饮汁去小儿暴热，大人酒后热，鼻塞身热，去头中风热，利口齿，利大小肠。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164010-er3zwpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164010-er3zwpp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治烦渴、崩中，带下，五种黄病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164011-pygxfye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164011-pygxfye"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【圣惠】捣汁日服六七合，治小便出血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122163959-qbd2jia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122163959-qbd2jia"}},{"ID":"20240122164012-jnuxcq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164012-jnuxcq3"}},{"ID":"20240122164012-cw0w4lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164012-cw0w4lz","updated":"20240204154323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"356是水靳。我们有陆上的靳就是我们现在吃的芹菜，还有一种靳菜是生在水里面的。现在水里面的靳菜的叶子跟陆上的靳菜叶子不同，陆上的靳菜叶子比较大，生在水里面的比较长，细长象竹叶一样那是水靳，那水靳呢，这种解热止血健胃的药，止血的功能很好，味甘性平，药性是比较平和的，会用到水靳的在食物里面用，比如一些解酒啊，小孩子发高烧啊，统统可以，小便出血，这是食物类的东西，这个可以常常吃没有关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240122164016-mgmmbck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164016-mgmmbck"}},{"ID":"20240122164019-r7t4r95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164019-r7t4r95"}},{"ID":"20240122164019-rme4s8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164019-rme4s8j","updated":"20240122164023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"彼子"}]},{"ID":"20240122164021-2lc252e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164021-2lc252e","updated":"20240122164027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，温，有毒。治腹中邪气，去三虫，蛇螫，蛊毒，鬼疰，伏尸。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122164027-wlxdpoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122164027-wlxdpoq","updated":"20240204154342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那最后一味，357这个彼子，很少用，现在几乎已经没有人在使用了。那本草本来有三百六十，后面少了几味，因为那，我跟大家诸位讲，缺失掉了，缺失掉还有些摆在里面可是现代人已经没有人没有办法去认得它了。"}]}]}